{
  "readme": [
    "Maps each component in the Figma file to its code component, Storybook stories, variants, props and tokens. Read it together with src/design-system.md (the rules) before any design system work.",
    "Use figma.id and figma.url to open a component in Figma, code.file and code.export to find it in code, and story.ids to preview it in Storybook (http://localhost:6006/?path=/story/<id>).",
    "status: mapped = a code component (custom, or an MUI component used as is). unmapped = Figma only, no standalone code component.",
    "tokens.direct are variables bound on the component itself, tokens.inherits are components nested inside it, tokens.literal are values that are not tokens. Look up every token name in tokenIndex.",
    "figmaOnly props exist only in Figma. codeOnly props exist only in code. mismatches lists known differences between Figma and code.",
    "When you change a component's props, variants or tokens, update its entry here and its Figma component and Storybook story. Do not guess a mapping that is not in this file."
  ],
